1
00:01:42,719 --> 00:01:43,680
Lately,

2
00:01:43,879 --> 00:01:44,840
who have you seen?

3
00:01:45,120 --> 00:01:46,599
Has anyone contacted you?

4
00:01:48,640 --> 00:01:50,560
I haven't seen anyone out of the ordinary.

5
00:01:51,319 --> 00:01:52,799
Think carefully.

6
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:53,920
Are you sure there's no one?

7
00:01:56,599 --> 00:01:57,400
Wait.

8
00:01:57,719 --> 00:01:59,079
I met Grace the other day.

9
00:01:59,319 --> 00:02:00,840
She recommended a stock to me.

10
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:08,000
This one right here.

11
00:02:11,639 --> 00:02:12,840
I think I get it.

12
00:02:15,360 --> 00:02:18,039
Hades tried to stage a terrorist attack last time

13
00:02:18,240 --> 00:02:19,520
to affect Huatie's stock,

14
00:02:19,759 --> 00:02:20,879
but he didn't succeed.

15
00:02:20,960 --> 00:02:21,759
This time,

16
00:02:22,039 --> 00:02:23,360
Wei Tian, you defusing the bomb

17
00:02:23,439 --> 00:02:24,599
made us famous

18
00:02:24,800 --> 00:02:26,240
and disrupted his plans again.

19
00:02:28,240 --> 00:02:30,439
But why are they only targeting you?

20
00:02:31,960 --> 00:02:34,039
I know why someone came to assassinate me.

21
00:02:35,039 --> 00:02:36,319
I represented you in court,

22
00:02:36,319 --> 00:02:37,639
cleared your name,

23
00:02:37,639 --> 00:02:39,000
disrupted their scheme,

24
00:02:39,080 --> 00:02:40,240
and grabbed a slice of the pie.

25
00:02:50,879 --> 00:02:51,680
I don't think

26
00:02:51,960 --> 00:02:53,719
it's as simple as grabbing a slice of the pie.

27
00:02:54,800 --> 00:02:56,080
This could get tricky.

28
00:03:10,840 --> 00:03:11,639
Wei Tian.

29
00:03:12,919 --> 00:03:15,319
Because of that report you made in Shenhai,

30
00:03:15,680 --> 00:03:17,240
you put me through living hell.

31
00:03:18,840 --> 00:03:20,439
Didn't you know what those things

32
00:03:20,520 --> 00:03:22,360
meant to me?

33
00:03:23,599 --> 00:03:25,599
Did the deaths of your wife and child

34
00:03:26,240 --> 00:03:28,120
not leave a deep enough impression?

35
00:03:38,159 --> 00:03:39,000
Seven years.

36
00:03:41,120 --> 00:03:42,319
After seven years,

37
00:03:42,599 --> 00:03:44,080
I won't kill you.

38
00:03:45,680 --> 00:03:47,520
But I'll make the people around you

39
00:03:48,199 --> 00:03:49,719
die one by one,

40
00:03:52,360 --> 00:03:55,159
so you know what true pain feels like.

41
00:04:24,720 --> 00:04:25,639
It's been seven years.

42
00:04:29,319 --> 00:04:30,399
In our hearts,

43
00:04:31,639 --> 00:04:32,959
the Silent Protectors will always be

44
00:04:32,959 --> 00:04:34,160
an unbreakable team.

45
00:04:39,160 --> 00:04:40,040
You know...

46
00:04:40,800 --> 00:04:41,639
I told you,

47
00:04:42,120 --> 00:04:43,360
no matter where you are,

48
00:04:44,639 --> 00:04:46,439
you'll always be in my sight.

49
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:45,839
I've been calling for ages,

50
00:05:45,839 --> 00:05:47,160
and no one's answering.

51
00:05:47,160 --> 00:05:47,959
Try again.

52
00:08:05,680 --> 00:08:06,480
Qin Huan!

53
00:08:11,120 --> 00:08:11,920
Qin Huan!

54
00:08:14,360 --> 00:08:15,160
Qin Huan!

55
00:08:17,399 --> 00:08:18,199
Qin Huan!

56
00:09:52,559 --> 00:09:53,159
Wei Tian.

57
00:09:53,159 --> 00:09:54,080
I still can't detect

58
00:09:54,080 --> 00:09:55,320
Luo Xi's phone signal.

59
00:09:55,320 --> 00:09:56,639
Luo Xi must have been attacked.

60
00:09:57,120 --> 00:09:57,919
Keep tracking her

61
00:09:57,919 --> 00:09:58,840
until you find her.

62
00:09:59,200 --> 00:10:00,000
Copy that.

63
00:10:05,639 --> 00:10:06,639
Out of the way! Out of the way!

64
00:10:08,240 --> 00:10:09,039
Watch out!

65
00:10:09,559 --> 00:10:10,480
Excuse me, coming through!

66
00:10:13,679 --> 00:10:14,759
Excuse me, make way! Thank you!

67
00:10:25,600 --> 00:10:26,399
Wei Tian.

68
00:10:26,639 --> 00:10:28,679
I still can't locate Luo Xi.

69
00:10:29,639 --> 00:10:30,360
Stop searching.

70
00:10:31,399 --> 00:10:31,919
Let's go.

71
00:10:32,080 --> 00:10:32,600
Where are we going?

72
00:10:32,799 --> 00:10:33,360
The hospital.

73
00:10:46,679 --> 00:10:47,759
The crash location

74
00:10:48,600 --> 00:10:50,120
wasn't sent to me by Luo Xi.

75
00:10:51,200 --> 00:10:52,000
Then who was it?

76
00:10:54,639 --> 00:10:56,679
Probably someone trying to save her.

77
00:11:49,320 --> 00:11:49,960
You drive.

78
00:11:52,440 --> 00:11:52,960
If I don't get out,

79
00:11:52,960 --> 00:11:54,399
neither of us will make it.

80
00:11:55,360 --> 00:11:56,440
If we die, we die together.

81
00:11:57,240 --> 00:11:58,039
Listen to me.

82
00:11:58,840 --> 00:11:59,720
You can't die.

83
00:11:59,879 --> 00:12:00,879
And I won't die either.

84
00:12:01,159 --> 00:12:02,399
We both have to live.

85
00:12:02,399 --> 00:12:03,639
We have to live so we can meet again.

86
00:12:28,840 --> 00:12:29,639
Let's go.

87
00:12:50,519 --> 00:12:51,960
Qin Huan, get in!

88
00:12:57,840 --> 00:12:58,639
Qin Huan!

89
00:13:04,559 --> 00:13:06,200
Qin Huan! Qin Huan!

90
00:14:58,440 --> 00:14:59,240
Charon.

91
00:14:59,440 --> 00:15:01,480
Have you forgotten who you are,

92
00:15:01,720 --> 00:15:02,720
or has something

93
00:15:02,799 --> 00:15:04,879
clouded your mind?

94
00:15:05,320 --> 00:15:06,240
Remember this:

95
00:15:06,360 --> 00:15:07,799
Someone is watching you.

96
00:15:43,399 --> 00:15:44,639
Luo Xi, you're awake.

97
00:15:47,679 --> 00:15:49,080
We were worried sick.

98
00:16:04,720 --> 00:16:05,519
Wei Tian,

99
00:16:06,279 --> 00:16:07,600
do you remember

100
00:16:08,360 --> 00:16:09,720
where you first saved me?

101
00:17:19,839 --> 00:17:20,640
Qin Huan.

102
00:17:47,200 --> 00:17:48,480
Qin Huan, get in.

103
00:17:52,079 --> 00:17:55,400
Here it is, your favorite Kenyan pour-over.

104
00:17:56,079 --> 00:17:57,160
You even know that?

105
00:17:57,160 --> 00:17:58,200
Of course I do.

106
00:17:58,759 --> 00:18:00,119
Kenyan coffee beans,

107
00:18:00,119 --> 00:18:02,119
medium roast with a hint of acidity.

108
00:18:02,119 --> 00:18:03,160
Your favorite.

109
00:18:03,319 --> 00:18:04,880
You also like stacking six sugar cubes

110
00:18:04,880 --> 00:18:06,599
into a pyramid shape,

111
00:18:06,920 --> 00:18:08,000
because you believe

112
00:18:08,319 --> 00:18:11,240
pyramids are considered lucky by the Egyptians.

113
00:18:11,240 --> 00:18:11,920
And also,

114
00:18:12,079 --> 00:18:15,079
the place you want to visit most is Kilimanjaro.

115
00:18:15,480 --> 00:18:17,799
You think if you make a wish facing a snow mountain,

116
00:18:17,799 --> 00:18:19,319
that wish will definitely come true.

117
00:18:19,839 --> 00:18:20,799
So what if I do?

118
00:18:22,640 --> 00:18:24,240
People always want to believe

119
00:18:24,319 --> 00:18:25,720
in something eternal.

120
00:18:26,920 --> 00:18:28,000
It just puzzles me.

121
00:18:28,000 --> 00:18:29,440
You're a hotshot lawyer,

122
00:18:29,440 --> 00:18:31,119
so how can you believe in things that never change?

123
00:18:31,279 --> 00:18:33,480
From the Code of Hammurabi until today,

124
00:18:33,720 --> 00:18:35,440
the only constant has been change.

125
00:18:36,279 --> 00:18:38,279
Precisely because everything is always changing,

126
00:18:38,440 --> 00:18:40,960
we're even more willing to believe

127
00:18:40,960 --> 00:18:42,599
in things that are eternal.

128
00:18:44,839 --> 00:18:46,319
Like me.

129
00:18:47,640 --> 00:18:48,720
Oh, please.

130
00:18:49,160 --> 00:18:50,880
You're always so absent-minded.

131
00:18:50,880 --> 00:18:51,960
What can you even remember?

132
00:18:54,920 --> 00:18:56,039
I remember you.

133
00:19:05,519 --> 00:19:06,359
What's this?

134
00:19:07,200 --> 00:19:09,240
Didn't you say I'm always forgetful?

135
00:19:09,599 --> 00:19:10,960
So I had both our names

136
00:19:10,960 --> 00:19:12,200
engraved on the necklaces.

137
00:19:12,240 --> 00:19:13,279
This way, I'll never forget.

138
00:19:14,880 --> 00:19:16,039
That's a great idea.

139
00:19:16,640 --> 00:19:18,000
Once we wear these necklaces,

140
00:19:18,200 --> 00:19:19,680
even when we're in our eighties

141
00:19:19,920 --> 00:19:21,240
and losing our memories,

142
00:19:21,559 --> 00:19:22,920
we'll never forget each other.

143
00:19:25,319 --> 00:19:29,720
So that means you've said yes?

144
00:19:32,079 --> 00:19:33,960
We've already traveled half the world.

145
00:19:34,200 --> 00:19:37,799
I want to stay here and take a good rest, too.

146
00:19:38,640 --> 00:19:40,720
I'll be with you to make all your wishes come true.

147
00:19:42,680 --> 00:19:44,079
Let me put the necklace on you, then.

148
00:19:44,079 --> 00:19:44,880
Come on, let's put it on.

149
00:19:59,079 --> 00:20:00,039
Let's take a picture.

150
00:20:00,039 --> 00:20:00,680
Sure.

151
00:20:05,079 --> 00:20:05,839
Is it on?

152
00:20:05,839 --> 00:20:06,759
You need to turn on the back too.

153
00:20:07,559 --> 00:20:08,680
Like this? Great.

154
00:20:09,079 --> 00:20:09,640
Hold on.

155
00:20:10,160 --> 00:20:10,799
Press the switch.

156
00:20:11,119 --> 00:20:12,039
Okay, okay.

157
00:20:12,720 --> 00:20:13,519
Coming!

158
00:20:15,160 --> 00:20:15,720
Ready.

159
00:20:16,319 --> 00:20:17,720
One, two...

160
00:21:21,000 --> 00:21:23,119
Anda, wait for me in the car.

161
00:21:23,519 --> 00:21:25,400
You can back us up if anything happens.

162
00:21:46,279 --> 00:21:46,880
Luo Xi.

163
00:21:49,359 --> 00:21:50,160
What's wrong?

164
00:21:52,400 --> 00:21:53,240
I remember.

165
00:21:54,440 --> 00:21:56,079
I remember how I got hurt.

166
00:21:59,559 --> 00:22:00,480
And that man.

167
00:22:02,359 --> 00:22:04,160
But I can't remember his face.

168
00:22:08,759 --> 00:22:09,680
Don't push yourself.

169
00:22:11,640 --> 00:22:14,160
It's already great that you remember this much.

170
00:22:15,279 --> 00:22:17,119
Take your time. Don't rush.

171
00:22:33,440 --> 00:22:34,240
Leave now.

172
00:22:36,640 --> 00:22:38,000
Anda, stay back!

173
00:22:51,920 --> 00:22:53,000
Open the car door.

174
00:22:57,880 --> 00:22:58,240
Move.

175
00:23:25,240 --> 00:23:26,440
Her vital signs are fairly normal.

176
00:23:26,440 --> 00:23:28,480
She still needs to stay for observation.

177
00:23:28,920 --> 00:23:29,400
Thank you.

178
00:23:29,400 --> 00:23:30,160
You're welcome.

179
00:23:34,200 --> 00:23:35,160
Looking back...

180
00:23:35,640 --> 00:23:38,440
four years ago, after Wei Tian saved me,

181
00:23:39,200 --> 00:23:41,799
I was lying in a hospital bed just like this.

182
00:23:48,960 --> 00:23:49,759
You are...?

183
00:23:50,480 --> 00:23:52,440
Hello, I'm Wei Tian.

184
00:23:55,000 --> 00:23:58,880
I'm sorry, I can't remember anything.

185
00:24:00,000 --> 00:24:00,559
I know.

186
00:24:01,599 --> 00:24:02,480
The doctor said

187
00:24:03,839 --> 00:24:05,119
you have partial amnesia.

188
00:24:06,839 --> 00:24:08,799
Do you remember your name?

189
00:24:12,480 --> 00:24:14,119
You have to have a name.

190
00:24:18,960 --> 00:24:19,880
Luo Xi.

191
00:24:23,279 --> 00:24:24,039
Luo Xi?

192
00:24:24,400 --> 00:24:25,759
Yeah, the name on your necklace.

193
00:24:26,240 --> 00:24:27,960
Why not go by Luo Xi?

194
00:24:29,839 --> 00:24:31,119
Let's go with Luo Xi, then.

195
00:24:31,240 --> 00:24:32,640
It's a nice name.

196
00:24:33,759 --> 00:24:35,200
What happened to me?

197
00:24:36,519 --> 00:24:39,000
You had an accident in the desert.

198
00:24:40,519 --> 00:24:42,839
You were the victim.

199
00:24:43,359 --> 00:24:44,240
And then?

200
00:24:44,559 --> 00:24:47,799
Then I brought you to the hospital.

201
00:24:50,279 --> 00:24:53,200
You've been in a coma for 20 years.

202
00:24:53,480 --> 00:24:54,440
Are you serious?

203
00:25:01,160 --> 00:25:03,720
The year is 2034.

204
00:25:05,559 --> 00:25:06,839
When you were admitted,

205
00:25:06,880 --> 00:25:11,799
the doctor said your brain went into hibernation.

206
00:25:13,119 --> 00:25:14,720
Even though you look young,

207
00:25:15,519 --> 00:25:18,839
you're actually an old lady now.

208
00:25:22,200 --> 00:25:23,680
No way. You're lying to me.

209
00:25:26,759 --> 00:25:28,480
So, can you get your memory back now?

210
00:25:28,799 --> 00:25:29,920
How much can you remember?

211
00:25:31,319 --> 00:25:31,759
Anything?

212
00:25:36,200 --> 00:25:36,640
Let me test you.

213
00:25:39,480 --> 00:25:40,279
What's this?

214
00:25:41,519 --> 00:25:42,559
That's a kettle.

215
00:25:44,480 --> 00:25:45,559
It's a microwave.

216
00:25:48,000 --> 00:25:49,799
What about the one behind you?

217
00:25:50,799 --> 00:25:51,920
A bouquet of flowers.

218
00:25:53,119 --> 00:25:54,240
It's a washing machine.

219
00:26:03,279 --> 00:26:04,160
What's this?

220
00:26:05,240 --> 00:26:07,880
Don't fool me. I'm not an idiot.

221
00:26:08,240 --> 00:26:09,839
It's just amnesia, that's all.

222
00:26:10,200 --> 00:26:13,039
That means you're slowly getting better. Great.

223
00:26:14,400 --> 00:26:15,039
That's good.

224
00:26:16,799 --> 00:26:17,799
The hospital told me

225
00:26:20,480 --> 00:26:21,519
that you're rich.

226
00:26:23,480 --> 00:26:24,279
So...

227
00:26:26,200 --> 00:26:27,200
the hospital bill,

228
00:26:29,039 --> 00:26:29,920
you have to settle it.

229
00:26:31,319 --> 00:26:32,039
Here's your receipt.

230
00:26:40,440 --> 00:26:41,599
Thinking back now,

231
00:26:42,359 --> 00:26:44,960
with the straight face he had

232
00:26:45,759 --> 00:26:47,720
while telling such an absurd joke,

233
00:26:47,720 --> 00:26:48,559
it was really...

234
00:26:49,000 --> 00:26:50,240
His expression was hilarious.

235
00:26:57,000 --> 00:26:59,200
Now that Luo Xi has her memory back,

236
00:26:59,519 --> 00:27:02,039
do you think she'll leave?

237
00:27:02,720 --> 00:27:04,200
It's hard to say.

238
00:27:04,720 --> 00:27:06,480
Usually, once people regain their memory,

239
00:27:07,319 --> 00:27:09,640
they want to get back to their past life,

240
00:27:10,240 --> 00:27:12,400
look for old friends,

241
00:27:13,119 --> 00:27:15,039
family, or lovers.

242
00:27:17,759 --> 00:27:18,559
You know what?

243
00:27:18,559 --> 00:27:20,079
Spending time with her lately,

244
00:27:20,079 --> 00:27:21,680
she really feels like family to me.

245
00:27:21,799 --> 00:27:22,839
I hate to see her go.

246
00:27:23,759 --> 00:27:25,880
That's because she sees us as family too,

247
00:27:25,880 --> 00:27:27,359
so she'd hate to leave as well.

248
00:27:27,960 --> 00:27:30,039
Still, Luo Xi regaining her memory

249
00:27:30,039 --> 00:27:31,039
is something to celebrate.

250
00:27:32,599 --> 00:27:33,519
She told me

251
00:27:33,799 --> 00:27:36,000
that she came here

252
00:27:36,000 --> 00:27:36,960
with a friend.

253
00:27:36,960 --> 00:27:38,720
But what she used to do,

254
00:27:38,720 --> 00:27:40,240
why she came here,

255
00:27:40,240 --> 00:27:42,039
and what happened to her, she's forgotten.

256
00:27:42,200 --> 00:27:45,079
Yet there was always

257
00:27:45,079 --> 00:27:46,400
a man by her side.

258
00:27:46,799 --> 00:27:49,079
Do you think she'll go look for him?

259
00:27:50,200 --> 00:27:52,599
Is he related to Luo Xi?

260
00:27:54,119 --> 00:27:57,720
From what she said, sounds more like a lover.

261
00:27:58,880 --> 00:28:00,079
If he's her lover,

262
00:28:00,079 --> 00:28:02,359
I think she should return to her own life.

263
00:28:02,920 --> 00:28:03,720
Uncle Qu!

264
00:28:05,680 --> 00:28:07,680
I spared no expense today.

265
00:28:07,680 --> 00:28:08,759
Look at all the groceries I bought!

266
00:28:10,119 --> 00:28:11,920
What dishes are you making?

267
00:28:12,960 --> 00:28:14,000
Vietnamese spring rolls,

268
00:28:14,519 --> 00:28:15,440
Indian green curry...

269
00:28:16,119 --> 00:28:17,599
All my favorites!

270
00:28:18,720 --> 00:28:20,279
Did you get everything I asked for?

271
00:28:20,559 --> 00:28:21,359
Got it all.

272
00:28:21,359 --> 00:28:23,359
I waited in line for so long!

273
00:28:24,119 --> 00:28:25,920
Free food and drinks for me again!

274
00:28:26,079 --> 00:28:27,559
Stop thinking only about eating and drinking.

275
00:28:27,759 --> 00:28:28,519
Don't forget,

276
00:28:28,519 --> 00:28:30,359
Luo Xi is the guest of honor today.

277
00:28:31,119 --> 00:28:32,279
You're washing the dishes after dinner.

278
00:28:32,720 --> 00:28:33,519
Got it.

279
00:28:33,799 --> 00:28:34,200
Let's go.

280
00:28:37,240 --> 00:28:38,920
Heavens! So much food!

281
00:28:40,160 --> 00:28:42,319
Isn't this just for my discharge?

282
00:28:42,640 --> 00:28:44,000
Why make such a huge fuss?

283
00:28:44,440 --> 00:28:45,599
It feels like New Year's!

284
00:28:45,640 --> 00:28:46,279
Luo Xi,

285
00:28:46,279 --> 00:28:48,279
didn't you say you forgot your birthday?

286
00:28:48,279 --> 00:28:49,160
So this time,

287
00:28:49,200 --> 00:28:51,000
we're throwing you a birthday party!

288
00:28:51,000 --> 00:28:52,680
Come on, happy birthday!

289
00:28:53,400 --> 00:28:54,039
Thank you.

290
00:28:54,400 --> 00:28:56,359
A... a birthday?

291
00:28:56,640 --> 00:28:57,839
Just decided on a whim?

292
00:28:58,240 --> 00:28:59,680
Why not celebrate right here and now?

293
00:28:59,680 --> 00:29:00,440
Look,

294
00:29:00,440 --> 00:29:02,720
today's the day you were discharged,

295
00:29:02,720 --> 00:29:04,160
a wonderful day, right?

296
00:29:04,160 --> 00:29:05,160
A day of good health.

297
00:29:05,160 --> 00:29:05,880
And since you don't know

298
00:29:05,880 --> 00:29:07,319
the exact date of your birthday,

299
00:29:07,519 --> 00:29:08,960
you might as well pick a lucky day.

300
00:29:08,960 --> 00:29:11,119
No need to pick—we celebrate today!

301
00:29:12,519 --> 00:29:13,599
Thank you, Captain.

302
00:29:14,799 --> 00:29:16,240
Thank you, Wei Tian.

303
00:29:18,480 --> 00:29:19,880
Thank you, Sha Lan.

304
00:29:22,039 --> 00:29:23,400
Thank you, Anda.

305
00:29:23,400 --> 00:29:26,799
Here it comes! The cake is here!

306
00:29:27,759 --> 00:29:28,759
Let's sing! Sing!

307
00:29:29,039 --> 00:29:37,480
Happy birthday to you...

308
00:29:37,480 --> 00:29:38,880
Make a wish! Make a wish.

309
00:29:45,759 --> 00:29:46,559
Happy birthday!

310
00:29:46,559 --> 00:29:47,519
Happy birthday!

311
00:29:48,160 --> 00:29:50,680
Come on, cheers, everyone!

312
00:29:50,880 --> 00:29:52,160
Cheers! Cheers!

313
00:29:52,160 --> 00:29:52,720
Come on!

314
00:29:52,720 --> 00:29:53,640
Thank you!

315
00:29:53,640 --> 00:29:54,799
Let's clink glasses!

316
00:29:55,000 --> 00:29:56,880
Thank you, thank you all.

317
00:30:12,559 --> 00:30:13,920
This wine is a fake.

318
00:30:14,480 --> 00:30:15,640
Get your manager over here.

319
00:30:19,960 --> 00:30:23,200
Hello, I'm Anda from Plato Hotel.

320
00:30:24,920 --> 00:30:28,279
You haven't even taken a sip yet.

321
00:30:28,400 --> 00:30:30,160
How do you know it's fake?

322
00:30:33,960 --> 00:30:34,759
It's fine.

323
00:30:36,920 --> 00:30:40,079
This wine was produced three years ago.

324
00:30:40,359 --> 00:30:42,200
It has aged to perfection.

325
00:30:42,880 --> 00:30:43,720
There's nothing wrong with it.

326
00:30:44,960 --> 00:30:46,160
Exactly one year ago today,

327
00:30:46,440 --> 00:30:49,079
I left this bottle with the hotel for safekeeping.

328
00:30:49,559 --> 00:30:51,279
We agreed that one year later, today,

329
00:30:51,279 --> 00:30:52,599
I'd open it and drink it.

330
00:30:53,160 --> 00:30:55,960
Yet now, the bottle has been swapped.

331
00:30:57,119 --> 00:30:58,000
Ma'am,

332
00:30:58,319 --> 00:30:59,519
you claim it was swapped,

333
00:31:00,519 --> 00:31:03,079
but we sealed and stored this bottle

334
00:31:03,079 --> 00:31:04,079
strictly according to your request.

335
00:31:04,599 --> 00:31:05,680
Only when you returned

336
00:31:05,680 --> 00:31:06,839
did we take it out.

337
00:31:07,680 --> 00:31:09,000
Do you have any proof?

338
00:31:11,599 --> 00:31:13,759
No wonder you can't tell.

339
00:31:17,559 --> 00:31:18,119
Look here.

340
00:31:19,200 --> 00:31:21,000
There was a signature on the bottom right of the label.

341
00:31:21,440 --> 00:31:22,960
It was my fiancé's name.

342
00:31:24,000 --> 00:31:25,559
It was our little secret.

343
00:31:26,440 --> 00:31:28,519
Yet on the bottle you just handed me,

344
00:31:28,680 --> 00:31:31,079
there's no signature on the label at all.

345
00:31:31,599 --> 00:31:33,920
Doesn't that prove it's fake?

346
00:31:36,720 --> 00:31:37,519
This bottle

347
00:31:37,880 --> 00:31:39,839
isn't the one I stored here.

348
00:31:41,119 --> 00:31:43,400
I signed an agreement with the hotel,

349
00:31:43,920 --> 00:31:45,839
paid a full year's storage fee,

350
00:31:46,640 --> 00:31:48,160
and even took photos as proof.

351
00:31:48,799 --> 00:31:50,200
How dare you try to deceive me!

352
00:31:52,079 --> 00:31:53,200
I'm truly sorry.

353
00:31:53,559 --> 00:31:56,960
We'll find an identical bottle right away,

354
00:31:57,559 --> 00:31:59,359
from three years ago.

355
00:32:01,200 --> 00:32:02,960
I don't care about drinking the wine!

356
00:32:03,400 --> 00:32:05,319
I just want his signature back.

357
00:32:12,920 --> 00:32:14,200
Yang Di, let me tell you,

358
00:32:14,240 --> 00:32:15,079
not to harp on you,

359
00:32:15,720 --> 00:32:17,160
but do I really have to handle everything myself?

360
00:32:17,160 --> 00:32:18,079
What on earth happened?

361
00:32:18,519 --> 00:32:20,640
Well, this guest's fiancé

362
00:32:20,640 --> 00:32:22,119
stored a bottle of wine at our hotel,

363
00:32:22,119 --> 00:32:23,720
but that bottle is now missing.

364
00:32:23,720 --> 00:32:24,960
Isn't that simple?

365
00:32:25,319 --> 00:32:26,440
Buy an identical one

366
00:32:26,440 --> 00:32:27,799
and give it to her. Problem solved.

367
00:32:28,319 --> 00:32:29,640
The wine is easy enough,

368
00:32:29,759 --> 00:32:31,559
but the guest's husband...

369
00:32:31,559 --> 00:32:32,799
he's a painter.

370
00:32:32,799 --> 00:32:34,079
And on that bottle's label,

371
00:32:34,079 --> 00:32:35,279
there was his signature.

372
00:32:36,319 --> 00:32:37,359
Isn't that even simpler?

373
00:32:37,359 --> 00:32:38,759
Just buy an identical bottle,

374
00:32:39,039 --> 00:32:40,359
take the wine with the identical label,

375
00:32:40,359 --> 00:32:41,119
bring it to the painter,

376
00:32:41,119 --> 00:32:42,960
have him sign it, and return it to her.

377
00:32:42,960 --> 00:32:43,519
Done.

378
00:32:44,200 --> 00:32:45,720
That painter... not long ago,

379
00:32:45,720 --> 00:32:47,039
died in a car accident.

380
00:32:47,640 --> 00:32:48,440
That's tragic.

381
00:32:50,440 --> 00:32:52,079
Mr. Xiao, you have no idea.

382
00:32:52,400 --> 00:32:53,400
Luo Qingxuan's family

383
00:32:53,400 --> 00:32:55,640
runs local trade and export businesses.

384
00:32:55,680 --> 00:32:56,599
Their business scope

385
00:32:56,599 --> 00:32:58,079
spans China and multiple African countries.

386
00:32:58,079 --> 00:32:59,240
They're real estate tycoons.

387
00:32:59,799 --> 00:33:01,119
What's more, her father

388
00:33:01,119 --> 00:33:02,640
is a board member of

389
00:33:02,640 --> 00:33:04,799
the government-run Antilocaris Times.

390
00:33:05,319 --> 00:33:06,680
If this isn't handled properly,

391
00:33:06,960 --> 00:33:09,359
the hotel's reputation will suffer.

392
00:33:09,359 --> 00:33:11,279
We might even be forced to suspend operations!

393
00:33:14,200 --> 00:33:15,920
Fine. Let's go take a look.

394
00:33:20,640 --> 00:33:21,440
Miss Luo.

395
00:33:22,759 --> 00:33:24,599
Hello, I'm the person in charge here.

396
00:33:24,680 --> 00:33:25,920
How may I help you?

397
00:33:31,519 --> 00:33:33,640
A renowned hotel chain like Plato Hotel,

398
00:33:33,680 --> 00:33:35,240
and you actually dare to deceive your guests!

399
00:33:35,880 --> 00:33:37,319
What else is there to say?

400
00:33:38,279 --> 00:33:39,559
Unless you find that bottle,

401
00:33:39,880 --> 00:33:41,119
I won't let this go.

402
00:33:43,440 --> 00:33:44,160
Miss Luo,

403
00:33:44,160 --> 00:33:46,440
regarding your missing bottle of wine,

404
00:33:46,559 --> 00:33:47,599
I've been fully briefed.

405
00:33:47,960 --> 00:33:49,880
Today, I solemnly promise you

406
00:33:50,839 --> 00:33:52,880
that within three days,

407
00:33:52,880 --> 00:33:55,279
I will track down that bottle for you.

408
00:33:57,880 --> 00:34:00,680
Fine. Three days. I'll be waiting.

409
00:34:25,079 --> 00:34:25,519
Enjoy your meal.

410
00:34:25,880 --> 00:34:26,440
Thank you.

411
00:34:42,119 --> 00:34:43,000
You're so skilled at this,

412
00:34:43,000 --> 00:34:44,000
and know how to savor things.

413
00:34:44,559 --> 00:34:46,199
You must've loved life back then,

414
00:34:46,199 --> 00:34:47,480
someone who truly enjoyed living.

415
00:34:49,840 --> 00:34:51,199
It's just a hobby of mine.

416
00:34:51,360 --> 00:34:52,559
From back then until now,

417
00:34:52,679 --> 00:34:53,880
it's never changed.

418
00:34:55,000 --> 00:34:56,039
I've made up my mind.

419
00:34:56,039 --> 00:34:57,159
In the future, this place

420
00:34:57,199 --> 00:34:59,000
will be reserved for you to serve coffee.

421
00:34:59,000 --> 00:35:00,000
You'll run it.

422
00:35:01,000 --> 00:35:01,960
Give me a break.

423
00:35:02,199 --> 00:35:03,559
I don't want that kind of hassle.

424
00:35:04,280 --> 00:35:06,760
I'm only cut out for enjoying life.

425
00:35:09,119 --> 00:35:10,000
Figures.

426
00:35:10,639 --> 00:35:11,719
Every one of you

427
00:35:12,119 --> 00:35:14,400
is just passing through my life.

428
00:36:21,440 --> 00:36:24,239
Won't it be too sweet with that much sugar?

429
00:36:27,519 --> 00:36:29,840
Someone once taught me this.

430
00:36:30,840 --> 00:36:31,840
He said it was a way

431
00:36:31,880 --> 00:36:33,800
to enjoy the sweetness of life.

432
00:36:35,280 --> 00:36:36,079
Except...

433
00:36:38,119 --> 00:36:41,159
I could never remember his face.

434
00:36:47,000 --> 00:36:50,639
Look at me. Do I look a bit like him?

435
00:36:55,119 --> 00:36:56,519
Taking a closer look...

436
00:36:56,760 --> 00:36:58,039
you really are...

437
00:36:58,760 --> 00:36:59,840
nothing like him at all.

438
00:37:01,239 --> 00:37:02,679
You're no fun.

439
00:37:02,960 --> 00:37:04,199
Boss, get me a drink.

440
00:37:04,360 --> 00:37:05,519
Sure, coming right up.

441
00:38:06,239 --> 00:38:07,719
Luo Xi, where are you?

442
00:38:07,960 --> 00:38:08,760
Sha Lan.

443
00:38:08,840 --> 00:38:10,400
I'm at the Casablanca Bar.

444
00:38:10,400 --> 00:38:11,559
I'm heading back right now.

445
00:38:12,360 --> 00:38:13,159
Luo Xi...

446
00:38:13,719 --> 00:38:15,880
It's late. Don't rush back yet.

447
00:38:15,880 --> 00:38:16,960
I'll have Wei Tian pick you up.

448
00:38:16,960 --> 00:38:17,920
It's not safe out there.

449
00:38:18,159 --> 00:38:18,920
No need.

450
00:38:18,920 --> 00:38:20,800
I'll grab a cab and be back soon.

451
00:38:20,920 --> 00:38:21,440
I'm hanging up now.

452
00:38:33,239 --> 00:38:33,840
Wei Tian.

453
00:39:25,599 --> 00:39:26,320
Somebody help!

454
00:39:27,280 --> 00:39:29,239
Robbery! Robbery!

455
00:39:29,519 --> 00:39:30,559
Hurry, somebody help!

456
00:39:40,599 --> 00:39:42,480
Damn it, are you crazy?

457
00:39:59,119 --> 00:39:59,880
Sorry about that.

458
00:41:04,440 --> 00:41:05,079
Luo Xi.

459
00:41:10,760 --> 00:41:11,639
What are you doing here?

460
00:41:14,000 --> 00:41:14,559
Who was that?

461
00:41:15,599 --> 00:41:16,440
Who was that guy?

462
00:41:17,159 --> 00:41:19,400
No idea. Just someone passing by.

463
00:41:23,199 --> 00:41:24,000
Passing by?

464
00:41:25,840 --> 00:41:28,239
Coming out alone so late...

465
00:41:28,760 --> 00:41:29,760
It's not safe here.

466
00:41:34,320 --> 00:41:36,639
Before going back home, I just wanted

467
00:41:37,159 --> 00:41:39,480
to visit the place where I used to live

468
00:41:39,840 --> 00:41:41,119
and relive the memories once more.

469
00:41:42,199 --> 00:41:43,239
I'm sorry.

470
00:41:43,360 --> 00:41:44,639
I've caused you trouble.

471
00:41:44,679 --> 00:41:45,840
How is it trouble?

472
00:41:45,840 --> 00:41:46,719
We're family.

473
00:41:47,199 --> 00:41:48,719
The Captain, Sha Lan, and I...

474
00:41:48,920 --> 00:41:50,159
are so happy for you.

475
00:41:50,159 --> 00:41:51,320
You decided to go back home,

476
00:41:51,320 --> 00:41:52,599
which was the right decision.

477
00:41:55,239 --> 00:41:56,039
Thank you all.

478
00:41:56,840 --> 00:41:59,079
It's all right. Let's go home.

479
00:42:35,440 --> 00:42:36,960
You've fallen for this woman.

480
00:42:37,800 --> 00:42:38,800
Are you kidding me?

481
00:42:39,559 --> 00:42:40,760
She's my target.

482
00:42:41,039 --> 00:42:42,920
Then why haven't you completed the mission?

483
00:42:45,159 --> 00:42:46,519
Because she's vigilant.

484
00:42:46,960 --> 00:42:48,239
She always has people around her.

485
00:42:48,239 --> 00:42:49,320
I haven't had a chance to make a move.

486
00:42:50,800 --> 00:42:52,079
Hades said

487
00:42:52,400 --> 00:42:54,119
we need to eliminate a few more people.

488
00:43:04,920 --> 00:43:05,719
Who?

489
00:43:05,840 --> 00:43:07,920
Chinese. A mercenary.

490
00:43:08,800 --> 00:43:10,119
A top-class sniper.

491
00:43:11,360 --> 00:43:14,159
He's fought in many countries.

492
00:43:15,320 --> 00:43:16,960
Highly experienced.

493
00:43:17,159 --> 00:43:18,880
He's the eyes of the Silent Protectors.

494
00:43:19,159 --> 00:43:21,880
Before the mission, we must slowly clip

495
00:43:21,880 --> 00:43:23,480
Wei Tian's wings.

496
00:43:23,480 --> 00:43:24,480
Is he really that good?

497
00:43:24,960 --> 00:43:25,960
I don't think so.

498
00:43:26,119 --> 00:43:27,760
Don't underestimate his capabilities.

499
00:43:28,440 --> 00:43:30,960
He's thwarted our plans multiple times.

500
00:43:31,679 --> 00:43:32,760
The reason you were sent

501
00:43:32,960 --> 00:43:35,199
is that you're both top-tier snipers.

502
00:43:35,360 --> 00:43:36,880
I don't plan on losing to anyone.
